{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05909","headline":"偶然作六首 四 · 王维","name":"偶然作六首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陶潜任天真，其性颇躭酒。\n自从弃官来，家贫不能有。\n九月九日时，菊花空满手。\n中心窃自思，傥有人送否。\n白衣携壶觞，果来遗老叟。\n且喜得斟酌，安问升与斗。\n奋衣野田中，今日嗟无负。\n兀傲迷东西，蓑笠不能守。\n倾倒强行行，酣歌归五柳。\n生事不曾问，肯媿家中妇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05909.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05909","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}